WEBVTT

00:00:24.608 --> 00:00:25.858
(ALL SNARLING)

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:28.319
(MEOWING)

00:00:31.239 --> 00:00:33.240
- (PURRING)
- Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:00:34.951 --> 00:00:37.870
Okay. Wait. Hold it there, please.

00:00:39.331 --> 00:00:40.498
Come on. (GRUNTS)

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:43.125
Oh! (LAUGHING)

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:44.377
All right.

00:00:48.006 --> 00:00:49.256
- (TINKLING)
- NEWT: Okay, wait.

00:00:49.925 --> 00:00:51.258
- (PURRING)
- (TINKLING)

00:00:58.266 --> 00:00:59.684
(SIGHS IN RELIEF)

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:05.898
YUSUF: You, go back.
Move! Out of the way!

00:01:07.609 --> 00:01:09.819
If I must kill you as well as Corvus,
I shall.

00:01:11.029 --> 00:01:12.029
Stop!

00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:17.493
Yusuf.

00:01:18.995 --> 00:01:20.621
Is that really you?

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:28.421
My little sister?

00:01:30.882 --> 00:01:32.800
CREDENCE: So he's your brother.

00:01:34.594 --> 00:01:36.095
Who am I?

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:38.180
I don't know.

00:01:38.348 --> 00:01:40.891
I'm tired of living with no name
and no history.

00:01:43.854 --> 00:01:46.439
Just tell me my story,
then you can end it.

00:01:46.606 --> 00:01:48.274
Your story is our story.

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:55.197
- Our story.
- No, Yusuf.

00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:14.133
YUSUF: My father was Mustafa Kama.

00:02:14.718 --> 00:02:18.220
Pure-blood of Senegalese descent
and most accomplished.

00:02:19.514 --> 00:02:21.223
My mother, Laurena,

00:02:22.684 --> 00:02:25.436
was equally highbred, a noted beauty.

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:28.230
<i>They were deeply in love.</i>

00:02:30.317 --> 00:02:34.487
<i>They knew a man of great influence</i>
<i>from a famous French pure-blood family.</i>

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:38.199
<i>He desired her.</i>

00:02:38.784 --> 00:02:41.619
<i>Maman. Maman!</i>

00:02:42.287 --> 00:02:47.208
<i>Lestrange used the Imperius Curse</i>
<i>to seduce and abduct her.</i>

00:02:48.543 --> 00:02:51.128
I tried to prevent it,
but he attacked me.

00:02:52.881 --> 00:02:54.799
That was the last time I ever saw her.

00:02:57.427 --> 00:03:00.721
<i>- She died giving birth to a little girl.</i>
- (BABY COOING)

00:03:02.349 --> 00:03:03.516
You.

00:03:06.895 --> 00:03:10.981
<i>The news of her death</i>
<i>drove my father insane.</i>

00:03:11.775 --> 00:03:13.275
With his dying breath,

00:03:14.236 --> 00:03:17.947
my father charged me to seek revenge.

00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:22.493
Kill the person Lestrange loves
best in the world.

00:03:23.662 --> 00:03:25.704
I thought at first it'd be easy.

00:03:26.665 --> 00:03:28.541
He had only one close relative.

00:03:29.668 --> 00:03:30.876
You.

00:03:31.044 --> 00:03:32.127
But he... (SIGHS)

00:03:32.587 --> 00:03:33.796
Say it.

00:03:34.714 --> 00:03:36.340
YUSUF: He never loved you.

00:03:40.554 --> 00:03:43.514
<i>He remarried,</i>
<i>and not three months after her death.</i>

00:03:47.352 --> 00:03:49.520
<i>He loved her no more</i>
<i>than he had loved you.</i>

00:03:53.567 --> 00:03:58.070
<i>But then his son, Corvus,</i>
<i>was born at last.</i>

00:03:58.238 --> 00:04:02.908
<i>And that man who had never known love</i>
<i>was filled with it.</i>

00:04:03.451 --> 00:04:05.286
<i>All he cared about</i>

00:04:05.871 --> 00:04:07.413
was little Corvus.

00:04:10.917 --> 00:04:12.626
So this is the truth?

00:04:14.045 --> 00:04:15.880
I am Corvus Lestrange?

00:04:16.047 --> 00:04:17.882
- Yes. Yes.
- No. No

00:04:18.049 --> 00:04:21.468
YUSUF: Realizing that Mustafa Kama's son
had sworn revenge,

00:04:21.553 --> 00:04:24.221
your father sought to hide you
where I couldn't find you.

00:04:25.223 --> 00:04:29.518
So he confided you to his servant,
who boarded a ship for America.

00:04:29.686 --> 00:04:32.730
- He did send Corvus to America, but...
- YUSUF: His servant, Irma Dugard,

00:04:33.356 --> 00:04:34.690
was a half-elf.

00:04:35.233 --> 00:04:36.567
Her magic was weak,

00:04:36.735 --> 00:04:38.819
and therefore left no trace
I could follow.

00:04:41.156 --> 00:04:44.283
I had only just discovered
how you had escaped

00:04:44.451 --> 00:04:46.660
when I received news I never expected.

00:04:47.162 --> 00:04:49.830
The ship had gone down at sea.

00:04:50.457 --> 00:04:52.082
But you survived, didn't you?

00:04:53.335 --> 00:04:56.337
Somehow, someone had pulled you
from the water.

00:04:57.505 --> 00:05:00.007
"A son cruelly banished
Despair of the daughter

00:05:00.175 --> 00:05:02.885
"Return, great avenger,
With wings from the water."

00:05:03.345 --> 00:05:05.721
There stands the despairing daughter.

00:05:05.889 --> 00:05:09.308
You are the winged raven,
returned from the sea,

00:05:11.728 --> 00:05:13.437
but I'm the avenger of my family's ruin.

00:05:16.191 --> 00:05:17.816
I pity you, Corvus.

00:05:19.778 --> 00:05:21.195
But you must die.

00:05:21.363 --> 00:05:24.281
Corvus Lestrange is already dead!
I killed him!

00:05:30.747 --> 00:05:31.747
<i>Accio!</i>

00:05:49.724 --> 00:05:52.810
My father owned
a very strange family tree.

00:05:56.439 --> 00:05:58.190
It only recorded the men.

00:06:02.696 --> 00:06:04.947
The women in my family
were recorded as flowers.

00:06:08.243 --> 00:06:09.410
Beautiful.

00:06:11.663 --> 00:06:12.830
Separate.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.543
<i>My father sent me to America</i>
<i>with Corvus.</i>

00:06:20.588 --> 00:06:22.172
- (THUNDER RUMBLING)
- (WIND HOWLING)

00:06:23.758 --> 00:06:26.468
<i>Irma was to pose as a grandmother</i>
<i>with two grandchildren.</i>

00:06:26.553 --> 00:06:28.137
(CORVUS CRYING)

00:06:32.225 --> 00:06:34.309
<i>Corvus never stopped crying.</i>

00:06:38.898 --> 00:06:40.190
WOMAN: Do you have any news?

00:06:40.358 --> 00:06:41.984
SAILOR: All hands to station!

00:06:42.777 --> 00:06:44.611
- Run to station!
- (CRYING CONTINUES)

00:06:53.079 --> 00:06:55.247
<i>- LETA: I never wanted to hurt him.</i>
- (CRYING CONTINUES)

00:07:00.587 --> 00:07:02.463
<i>I only wanted to be free of him.</i>

00:07:03.256 --> 00:07:04.673
<i>Just for a moment.</i>

00:07:10.138 --> 00:07:12.181
<i>- Just a single moment.</i>
- (CRYING CONTINUES)

00:07:17.562 --> 00:07:19.063
Give him to me.

00:07:20.106 --> 00:07:21.732
SAILOR: Everyone, to the lifeboats!

00:07:21.816 --> 00:07:23.609
WOMAN: They want us
to put on life jackets.

00:07:26.571 --> 00:07:28.447
(CORVUS CRYING)

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:40.250
(GASPING)

